    placeholder UI  |  Matcha LuaVM  |  Drawing-only, single file, no loadstring layer
    Naming: nothing here reuses Matcha's own menu API names (UI, AddTab, Section, Toggle,
    Keybind, SliderInt, SliderFloat, Combo, Button, ColorPicker, InputText, Text, Tip, Spacing).
    Ours: Lime.Create, hub:Page, page:Box, box:Switch / Slider / Choice / Multi / Popover /
          KeyPill / Entry / Buttons / ThemeList / Caption, hub:Toast, hub:Get / hub:Set

    Design: immediate-mode drawing on top of a pooled set of Drawing objects.
